     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I have the following (simplied) data:<div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><font color=\"#666600\"><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggplot2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></font></div></code><div><font color=\"#666600\" face=\"monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\" face=\"monospace\">survey_month&lt;-c(&quot;2020-01&quot;, &quot;2020-01&quot;,&quot;2020-01&quot;, &quot;2020-01&quot;, &quot;2020-01&quot;,&quot;2020-02&quot;, &quot;2020-02&quot;, &quot;2020-02&quot;,&quot;2020-03&quot;, &quot;2020-03&quot;, &quot;2020-03&quot;,&quot;2020-04&quot;, &quot;2020-04&quot;, &quot;2020-04&quot;,&quot;2020-04&quot;, &quot;2020-04&quot;, &quot;2020-04&quot;,&quot;2020-03&quot; )</font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace\">sport&lt;-c(&quot;golf&quot;,&quot;golf&quot;,&quot;golf&quot;,&quot;cricket&quot;,&quot;football&quot;,&quot;golf&quot;,&quot;cricket&quot;,&quot;football&quot;,&quot;golf&quot;,&quot;cricket&quot;,&quot;football&quot;,&quot;golf&quot;,&quot;cricket&quot;,&quot;football&quot;,&quot;cricket&quot;,&quot;cricket&quot;,&quot;football&quot;,&quot;golf&quot; )</span><br></div><div><font color=\"#666600\" face=\"monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\" face=\"monospace\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#666600\" face=\"monospace\">df &lt;- data.frame(sport,survey_month)</font></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,0);font-family:monospace\">ggplot(data=df,aes(x=survey_month)) + geom_bar(aes(fill=sport),width=0.4)</span><br></div><div><br></div></div><br>which gives</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/c284f26afdb64/5fd0895f-8382-437f-b775-f1c0a161a48c.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"5fd0895f-8382-437f-b775-f1c0a161a48c.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" width=\"400\" height=\"232\"></p><div>I wish to produce a bar chart, similar to this::</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/attach/c284f26afdb64/26-Jul-20%205-12-19%20PM.png?part=0.2&amp;view=1\" alt=\"26-Jul-20 5-12-19 PM.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p><div>With lines between the bars.</div><div>Any suggestions on how to do this in R &amp; ggplot?</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
